  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Response and Building Long-term Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is designed to address and mitigate the effects of malnutrition exacerbated by el nio-induced droughts in Namibia. It focuses on both immediate emergency response and long-term resilience building through comprehensive nutrition interventions. By combining emergency nutrition services with resilience-building strategies, this project aims to provide immediate relief while strengthening community capacities to handle future challenges related to drought and malnutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
